"PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years, and so did February to March and October to November. In 2025, May to June ran 193% of normal and November to December just 42%. Grid 16972 had its driest year in 2007 at 51%.</p>"}
